        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-757, 1-1/4 Inch Diameter Ribbon and Reed Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe charm of this Crossed Indian Drum Cabinet Knob is perfect for traditional style homes. It is available in 6 beautiful finishes and two sizes, a 1-11/16 inch length and a 2-3/16 inch length. The line and cross design is traditional in French Colonial decor and will be sure to add a bit of old world charm to your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-853\"><b>Matching Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-12-inch-door-pull-rk-international-ph-4857\"><b>12\" Ribbon and Reed Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-757 Crossed Indian Drum Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-757:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-756:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
